  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you deal damage to a creature, you can roll a number of d4s equal to your Proficiency Bonus. You deal extra Necrotic damage to it equal to the total, and you regain Hit Points equal to the extra damage dealt. Once you use this benefit, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-dZgT9H5skW9GuRD7\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Touch of the Grave</em> spends the use and rolls the damage; then heal yourself by the same amount with <em>Drain</em>.</p></section>",
